于重庆开州浦里新区赵家片区和平村，规划面积3.6平方公里，其中建设用地2.88平方公里，规划结构为“两轴串七片”，两轴：科技创新轴、生态休闲轴；七片：门户产业片区、创新研发片区、中医药制造片区、医药器械片区、医药物流片区、产业配套片区。产业发展目标：构建“1+3+5”产业目标，1个核心产业-生物医药产业，3个发展平台-发展创新平台、公共服务平台、产业升级平台（主要是依托相关政策，发展创新型经济，加强人才培育，促进产业优化升级），5个特色产业-现代中医药产业、现代化学药产业、新型疫苗、医用材料、医药商贸物流。\"},\"component\":{\"width\":456.32,\"height\":227.08,\"name\":\"text\",\"prop\":\"text\"},\"option\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"fontSize\":16,\"fontWeight\":\"normal\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"split\":0,\"lineHeight\":24},\"left\":1383.56,\"top\":278.24,\"index\":\"430d0245-c4d2-46f4-bd94-e020011cd87c\",\"zIndex\":15},{\"title\":\"文本框\",\"name\":\"税收奖励\",\"icon\":\"icon-text\",\"img\":\"/img/text.852a3c54.png\",\"dataType\":0,\"dataFormatter\":\"\",\"data\":{\"value\":\"税收奖励\"},\"component\":{\"width\":140,\"height\":46.52,\"name\":\"text\",\"prop\":\"text\"},\"option\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":20,\"fontWeight\":\"normal\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"split\":0,\"lineHeight\":0},\"left\":1361.2,\"top\":531.36,\"index\":\"2d01bc2d-ea71-4601-8929-51d742eb2af8\",\"zIndex\":14},{\"title\":\"文本框\",\"name\":\"投资补助\",\"icon\":\"icon-text\",\"img\":\"/img/text.852a3c54.png\",\"dataType\":0,\"dataFormatter\":\"\",\"data\":{\"value\":\"投资补助\"},\"component\":{\"width\":140,\"height\":46.52,\"name\":\"text\",\"prop\":\"text\"},\"option\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":20,\"fontWeight\":\"normal\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"split\":0,\"lineHeight\":0},\"left\":1705.6,\"top\":533,\"index\":\"5cac86d3-0fff-4fe3-862d-5daf2a46ba84\",\"zIndex\":13},{\"title\":\"文本框\",\"name\":\"创新奖励\",\"icon\":\"icon-text\",\"img\":\"/img/text.852a3c54.png\",\"dataType\":0,\"dataFormatter\":\"\",\"data\":{\"value\":\"创新奖励\"},\"component\":{\"width\":140,\"height\":46.52,\"name\":\"text\",\"prop\":\"text\"},\"option\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":20,\"fontWeight\":\"normal\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"split\":0,\"lineHeight\":0},\"left\":1707.24,\"top\":606.8,\"index\":\"ec647bc4-9a79-42a2-8588-f6121d849e65\",\"zIndex\":12},{\"title\":\"文本框\"